# Today's lifecycle gaps -- a RATCHET for scripts/check_spine.py.
#
# Every object owes the ten phases of the card that opens
# docs/dev/contributing/adding-algorithms.md. A line here is one artifact
# an object does not have: make spine-check shows it as missing and passes.
# Gaps another gate already lists (docs/.user-docs-exempt) are held there
# and are not repeated here.
#
# THIS LIST ONLY SHRINKS. A line whose gap has closed fails as stale:
# delete it in the PR that does the work. A line the merge base did not
# hold fails as added, unless a commit of the branch declares it:
#
#   Spine-skip: <phase> <object>: <reason> (#<issue>)
#
# and then the line carries that reason and issue.
#
# Format:  <object> <phase>/<item>: <why>
